  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math> is divisible by <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math> or <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />So, <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo></math> <math><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>10</mn></math> polynomials are possible",
